// Azure: new role assignment (permissions granted)
// MITRE ATT&CK: Persistence / Privilege Escalation - T1098 Account Manipulation
// Granting a role is how access is given out in Azure - and how an attacker
// gives themselves or a backdoor identity more power.
// Known benign in this lab: Terraform granting the shutdown Logic App its role.
AzureActivity
| where OperationNameValue =~ "MICROSOFT.AUTHORIZATION/ROLEASSIGNMENTS/WRITE"
| where ActivityStatusValue == "Success"
| project TimeGenerated, Caller, CallerIpAddress, ResourceGroup,
          Scope = _ResourceId
